        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The MOST DIFFICULT Game Ever Made.</strong> A 3D platformer where you play as a seed traveling through 6 environments to save its village and succeed the dying World Tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401530/extras/2628d6a68db4bd04fcbebecd47e18976.avif?t=1765562751\" width=600 height=169 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Original Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original gameplay experience featuring unique levels and varied camera angles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- 6 Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 environments, each completely different from the others.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Multiple Difficulties</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulty levels: Easy, Normal, and for the bravest players, Hard Mode!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Statistics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The total number of deaths and the final time are displayed both during and at the end of the game, which is perfect for speedrunners.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Cube</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all 36 hidden cubes across the map to uncover the story of Seed!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The MOST DIFFICULT Game Ever Made.</strong> A 3D platformer where you play as a seed traveling through 6 environments to save its village and succeed the dying World Tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401530/extras/2628d6a68db4bd04fcbebecd47e18976.avif?t=1765562751\" width=600 height=169 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Original Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original gameplay experience featuring unique levels and varied camera angles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- 6 Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 environments, each completely different from the others.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Multiple Difficulties</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulty levels: Easy, Normal, and for the bravest players, Hard Mode!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Statistics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The total number of deaths and the final time are displayed both during and at the end of the game, which is perfect for speedrunners.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Cube</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all 36 hidden cubes across the map to uncover the story of Seed!</p>",
